From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] panfrost: name the (13, 8, 0) model row G725/G925 biblioklept

The (13, 8, 0) pan_model row covers Immortalis-G925, Mali-G725 and
Mali-G625 (one product id, named by core count). The row string said just
"G725", so model->name users (the GL_RENDERER string, "not supported"
errors, the bifrost compiler dump) called a G925 a G725. csf-v11/131 already
picks the Vulkan deviceName from the core count; it fell back to
model->name for the 6-9 core case, so spell "Mali-G725" there and let the
row read "Mali-G725/G925". The perf counter name stays "G725".

Cosmetic only; Vulkan deviceName is unchanged for every core count.
Build-only; no device test.
---
diff --git a/src/panfrost/model/pan_model.c b/src/panfrost/model/pan_model.c
index 48c9303..8cce1c9 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/model/pan_model.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/model/pan_model.c
@@ -113,7 +113,10 @@ const struct pan_model pan_model_list[] = {
 
    FIFTHGEN_MODEL(PAN_PROD_ID(12, 8, 0), 4, "G720",  "G720", MODEL_ANISO(ALL),  MODEL_TB_SIZES(65536, 32768),
                                               MODEL_RATES_X(4, 8, 32,  64, 128, 16)),
-   FIFTHGEN_MODEL(PAN_PROD_ID(13, 8, 0), 4, "G725",  "G725", MODEL_ANISO(ALL),  MODEL_TB_SIZES(65536, 65536),
+   /* One product id, three marketing names by core count (Immortalis-G925,
+    * G725, G625); panvk picks the Vulkan deviceName in
+    * panvk_marketing_name(). */
+   FIFTHGEN_MODEL(PAN_PROD_ID(13, 8, 0), 4, "G725/G925",  "G725", MODEL_ANISO(ALL),  MODEL_TB_SIZES(65536, 65536),
                                               MODEL_RATES_X(4, 8, 32, 128, 128, 16)),
    FIFTHGEN_MODEL(PAN_PROD_ID(14, 8, 0), 4, "G1-Ultra",  "G1", MODEL_ANISO(ALL),  MODEL_TB_SIZES(65536, 65536),
                                               MODEL_RATES(4, 8, 128)),
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_physical_device.c
index 6a79a73..a6d85a4 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_physical_device.c
@@ -1176,7 +1176,7 @@ panvk_marketing_name(const struct pan_model *model, unsigned core_count)
                                : "Mali-G620";
    case PAN_PROD_ID(13, 8, 0):
       return core_count >= 10 ? "Mali-G925-Immortalis"
-             : core_count >= 6 ? model->name
+             : core_count >= 6 ? "Mali-G725"
                                : "Mali-G625";
    default:
       return model->name;
